@host = http://127.0.0.1:5147

### Anonymous health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@enur.local",
  "password": "ChangeMe!Admin123"
}

### Protected ping
GET {{host}}/api/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Current user
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
